===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To move very quickly, ''especially'' while making a high-pitched hum.
# {{rfv-sense}} To spiral one's index finger toward a baby's belly and poke it, in order to provoke laughter for entertainment purposes.

===Interjection===
{{en-intj}}

# {{context|US|slang}} Used to acknowledge a [[witty]] [[comeback]].

